    "long_instructions": "#### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Show your flowchart to the AI so it understands your app’s logic. Then prompt:\r\n\r\n    > Based on the provided logic flowchart, please write the JavaScript required to make my web app function.\r\n\r\n2. Before accepting the code, carefully check that it matches your flowchart:\r\n\r\n    * **If sound is ON:** the volume should be set to 50 and show the active icon 🔊\r\n    * **If sound is OFF:** the volume should be set to 0 and show the slashed icon 🔇\r\n\r\n3. If something is incorrect, explain what the AI got wrong and ask it to revise the code so it matches your flowchart exactly.",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
